The patches in this directory modify libXfont (X.Org, https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxfont),
whose COPYING file collects MIT/X11-style permission notices (The Open Group, Digital Equipment
Corporation, Keith Packard and others).  The patches are released under the same terms: MIT
(text in ../../LICENSES/MIT.txt).  They are not part of the BSD-2-Clause license of the rest
of this repository (see ../../REUSE.toml).
